      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "創造出非常不可思議的空間。\n在５回合內，所有寶可夢\n攜帶的道具都會失去效果。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur crée une zone mystérieuse où les objets\ntenus par tous les Pokémon n’ont plus aucun effet\npendant cinq tours.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender erzeugt einen bizarren Raum, in dem über\nfünf Runden die Wirkung aller von Pokémon getragenen\nItems aufgehoben ist.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Crea un espacio misterioso que inutiliza todos los\nobjetos de los Pokémon durante cinco turnos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa crea una dimensione in cui l’effetto\ndegli strumenti di tutti i Pokémon è annullato\nper cinque turni.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user creates a bizarre area in which Pokémon’s\nheld items lose their effects for five turns.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "まか不思議な　空間を　つくる。\n５ターンの間　すべてのポケモンの\n道具の　効果が　なくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "制造出离奇的空间。\n在５回合内所有宝可梦\n携带道具的效果都会消失。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Crea un espacio misterioso que inutiliza todos los\nobjetos de los Pokémon durante cinco turnos.",
